  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c36f5b6be7490aae",
      "translationZh": "基本思想是，预训练语言模型在指令调优或 RLHF 教它如何聊天之前已经学到了很多。如果你只需要它在明确定义的选项之间进行选择，那么这种能力很可能已经存在于其概率分布中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2028af60d2b62a19",
      "translationZh": "模型可能已经知道。我们只需要停止让它写文章。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f52feeceba8247f",
      "translationZh": "hearim 将决策转换为一组受限的替代方案，读取模型对它们的概率，并通过 Jev Choice , Score , and Noul API format 返回结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a30e4efe44239a74",
      "translationZh": "我在一个独立的实现中已经使用这种底层技术超过一年 —之前。 hearim 本身是一个新的、独立的重新实现，专门围绕 Jev API contract 构建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "deaf4b9e6ea84cd3",
      "translationZh": "我不声称它能够复制 Jev 的架构、训练、校准、速度或性能。有趣的主张范围更窄：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a2b2eb4b41f3e88",
      "translationZh": "一个有用的 Jev-style 接口不一定需要一个专门的 Jev-style 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3976975b73f05aea",
      "translationZh": "实现、支持的后端、局限性、基准测试和技术细节如下：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
